Rule 8 (tensor inputs: vector-lengths must be broadcast-aligned)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = 1 ∧ ndim(v_2) = 1 ∧ (shape(v_1, 0) = shape(v_2, 0) ∨ shape(v_1, 0) = 1 ∨ shape(v_2, 0) = 1)
>>
Rule 9 (sequence shapes as tuple or list: lengths must match)
{v_1 : tuple(int) ⊎ list(int), v_2 : tuple(int) ⊎ list(int)} |= v_1.len = v_2.len ∧ v_1.len ≥ 0 ∧ v_2.len ≥ 0
