Rule 11 (shape tensor entries must be non-negative)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = 1 ∧ ndim(v_2) = 1 ∧ min(v_1) ≥ 0 ∧ min(v_2) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 12 (broadcast always valid if one shape tensor is all ones)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = 1 ∧ ndim(v_2) = 1 ∧ ((min(v_1) = 1 ∧ max(v_1) = 1) ∨ (min(v_2) = 1 ∧ max(v_2) = 1))
>>
